        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Account Information:</strong>
            Login credentials and account-related information
            if account registration is available.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Device Information:</strong>
            Device model, operating system, app version,
            and technical diagnostic information.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Usage Information:</strong>
            Information about how you interact with the app,
            including features accessed and preferences.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Location Information:</strong>
            Location information may be collected if you use
            features that require location access and grant
            the necessary permission.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

